flowchart TD
    TITLE["<b>AI CREDITS GOVERNANCE</b><br/>Owned evidence → controlled change → verified operation"]

    subgraph INPUTS["OWNED INPUTS · confirm authority, freshness, scope, and coverage"]
        direction LR
        I1["<b>Provider</b><br/>Usage · billing · settings · alerts"]
        I2["<b>Finance</b><br/>Rates · charges · funding · tolerance"]
        I3["<b>Identity & license</b><br/>Users · teams · organizations · SKUs"]
        I4["<b>Business & risk</b><br/>Need · value · security · interruption"]
    end

    EVIDENCE["<b>EVIDENCE RULE</b><br/>Preserve source + timestamp + limitations · mark unavailable data <b>UNKNOWN</b><br/>Reconcile differences before a material decision"]

    P1["<b>01 · PREPARE</b>  |  Service · Budget · Security · License<br/><b>Act:</b> set scope, roles, sources, handling, tests, success measures, and rollback<br/><b>Record:</b> scope · role matrix · source plan · test plan<br/><b>Gate:</b> owners accept authority, evidence handling, and decision rights"]

    P2["<b>02 · BASELINE</b>  |  Service · Budget · License · Administrator<br/><b>Act:</b> collect records, preserve gaps, reconcile totals, and explain variance<br/><b>Record:</b> source register · baseline worksheet · reconciliation<br/><b>Gate:</b> required values reconcile, or limitations are formally accepted"]

    P3["<b>03 · DESIGN</b>  |  Service · Business · Budget · Security · License<br/><b>ULB precedence:</b> Individual > Cost center > Universal (always hard-stop)<br/><b>Metered scopes:</b> Cost center · Organization · Enterprise (Stop usage required)<br/><b>Verify:</b> attribution · paid usage policy · enterprise exclusions<br/><b>Keep separate:</b> included usage controls · license allocations · access policies<br/><b>Gate:</b> every proposal has evidence, rationale, owner, duration, and review date"]

    P4["<b>04 · APPROVE</b>  |  Budget · Security · License · Business · Sponsor<br/><b>Decide:</b> profile · assignment · exception · pilot · support · change record<br/><b>Record:</b> decision · approvers · impact · authorized change · rollback trigger"]

    A{"<b>APPROVED FOR<br/>LIMITED CHANGE?</b>"}
    HOLD["<b>RETURN / DEFER</b><br/>Name owner + reason<br/>Resolve evidence, eligibility, exposure, or interruption risk"]

    P5["<b>05 · PILOT</b>  |  Pilot Lead · Administrator · Service · Support<br/><b>Act:</b> capture prior state, apply limited change, test actual behavior, monitor, reconcile<br/><b>Record:</b> before / after state · tests · measures · feedback<br/><b>Gate:</b> success and tolerance criteria are met"]

    G{"<b>PILOT MEETS<br/>SUCCESS + TOLERANCE?</b>"}

    P6["<b>06 · ROLLOUT</b>  |  Service · Administrator · Change · Business<br/><b>Act:</b> sequence waves, reconfirm evidence, communicate, apply, verify, and pause<br/><b>Record:</b> wave log · verification · communications · active register<br/><b>Gate:</b> assignments match the approved register and ownership is clear"]

    P7["<b>07 · OPERATE</b>  |  Service · Budget · Security · License · Business<br/><b>Act:</b> review, reconcile, resolve alerts, control changes, and retire stale profiles<br/><b>Record:</b> reviews · incidents · changes · exceptions · trends<br/><b>Gate:</b> verified provider state matches the active register"]

    MONITOR["<b>MONITOR & RESPOND</b>  |  display freshness and coverage<br/><b>75% Early warning:</b> validate data → refresh forecast → notify owners<br/><b>90% Critical:</b> escalate → assess continuity → approve and communicate action<br/><b>100% Limit reached:</b> use tested enforcement, incident, exception, or rollback path<br/><b>Cadence:</b> weekly · monthly · quarterly · event-driven"]

    REVIEW{"<b>REVIEW DECISION</b><br/>Retain · Revise · Roll back"}

    ROLLBACK["<b>ROLL BACK SAFELY</b><br/>Restore captured provider state + prior active register version<br/>Preserve decision, incident, test, communication, and reconciliation history"]

    REGISTER["<b>CONTROLLED EVIDENCE TRAIL</b><br/>At every gate: owner · source · approval · profile version · assignment · test · exception · review date<br/><b>Close only when verified provider state and the active register agree.</b>"]

    TITLE --> INPUTS
    I1 & I2 & I3 & I4 --> EVIDENCE
    EVIDENCE --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> A
    A -->|YES| P5
    A -->|NO| HOLD --> P2
    P5 --> G
    G -->|YES| P6 --> P7 --> MONITOR --> REVIEW
    G -->|NO| ROLLBACK
    REVIEW -->|RETAIN| P7
    REVIEW -->|REVISE| P3
    REVIEW -->|ROLL BACK| ROLLBACK
    ROLLBACK -->|RE-BASELINE BEFORE RETRY| P2
    P7 -.->|KEEP CURRENT| REGISTER
    ROLLBACK -.->|PRESERVE HISTORY| REGISTER

